# A rectangle drawn and constrained from nothing, on an empty sketch. The
# Segment tool draws four segments by snapping each to the corner before:
# the first, level, with its length 0.6 typed (d1), each later one level or
# plumb with its corner, so that the H and V suggestions are kept (h1, v1,
# h2, v2), the last ending on the first corner. Two Esc quit the tool and
# clear the selection. Fix, tool first, locks the first corner P1, then
# Equal on the selection of the first two sides makes a square (eq1):
# nothing is left free.
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 415 503
move 743 503 3
wait 2
text "0.6"
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 743 503
click L 743 503
click L 743 229
click L 743 229
click L 415 229
click L 415 229
click L 415 503
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.fix
wait 2
click L 415 503
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element L1 element L2
action tool.equal
wait 4
